Architecture: {{ ARCH }}
Maintainer: Gabriel Guillou <guillou.gabriel@gmail.com>
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Depends: linux-modules-arm (= {{ VER }})
Replaces: linux-modules-arm
Breaks: linux-modules-arm
Description: Device-specific kernel modules for {{ DEVICE }}
 This package contains the kernel modules specific to the {{ DEVICE }}
 device overlay (SoC, Ethernet PHY, MMC, USB, RTC). It is built on top
 of linux-modules-arm (ARM-generic modules) and must be installed
 alongside it.
